{"info": {"address1": "Village Nawada Fatehpur", "address2": "P.O. Sikanderpur, Badda Manesar District", "city": "Gurugram", "zip": "122004", "country": "India", "phone": "91 124 2290427", "fax": "91 124 2290676", "website": "https://www.unominda.com", "industry": "Auto Parts", "industryKey": "auto-parts", "industryDisp": "Auto Parts", "sector": "Consumer Cyclical", "sectorKey": "consumer-cyclical", "sectorDisp": "Consumer Cyclical", "longBusinessSummary": "Uno Minda Limited, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and supplies auto components and systems in India and internationally. It provides alloy wheels, automotive switches, horns, infotainment systems, speakers, socket assemblies, fuel hoses, sensors, actuators, controllers, telematics and connected solutions, alternate fuel systems, air filtration systems, canisters, seat head rest and arm rests, luggage boards, automotive wireless chargers, seat recliner mechanism, multi-mode drive switches, USB chargers, wheel covers, seat belts, shifters, cameras, air ducts and washer bottles, EA pads, spoilers, steering wheels with air bags, body sealings, fuel caps, and brake hoses. The company also offers automotive seats, switches and lights, heated grips, customized switches, die casting components, batteries, handle bar assemblies, combined braking systems, relays, and noise supressor caps; off board chargers, and battery management products; combination switches, lamps, traction motors, motor controllers, and intelligent transport systems; and lever combinations, DC converters, smart plugs, and FNR switches. It also offers sunroofs, blow molded parts, vehicle control unit, and telematics. In addition, the company provides products for 4 wheelers, 2/3 wheelers, 2 and 3-wheeler EVs, off road, and commercial vehicles. Further, it sells its products to original equipment manufacturers. The company was formerly known as Minda Industries Limited and changed its name to Uno Minda Limited in July 2022. The company was founded in 1958 and is headquartered in Gurugram, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ravi  Mehra ACS, FCA", "age": 64, "title": "MD & Whole Time Director", "yearBorn": 1961, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 74600000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sunil  Bohra C.A.", "age": 49, "title": "Group Chief Financial Officer", "yearBorn": 1976, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Tarun Kumar Srivastava", "title": "Compliance Officer & Company Secretary", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vivek  Jindal", "age": 49, "title": "CEO of Lighting and Alternate Fuel Systems Domain & Whole Time Director", "yearBorn": 1976, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 23700000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Amit Kumar Jain", "title": "Group Chief Technology Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Parna  Ghosh", "title": "Group Chief Information Officer & Data Protection Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ankur  Modi", "title": "Head of Treasury, Investor Relations & Corporate Communications", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Nitesh  Minda", "title": "Chief Marketing Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Garima  Garg", "title": "Group Chief Human Resource Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Anadi  Sinha", "age": 60, "title": "Senior President of Head- Real Estate & Corporate Affairs", "yearBorn": 1965, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}], "auditRisk": 5, "boardRisk": 3, "compensationRisk": 9, "shareHolderRightsRisk": 10, "overallRisk": 6, "governa